<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 3.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 3.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
